  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**  \nR19: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11589248)  \nR15: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11612569)\n\n**Official Translations:**   \n[T.Chinese](https://www.webtoons.com/zh-hant/romance-m/the-kiss-of-that-night/list?title_no=7287) \n\nA literal crazy night with a stranger in a strange place.\nHa Eun-Jo considered it a one-night stand and a secret. Until she met that man again in Seoul.\n\n\"Secretary Ha, we should introduce ourselves quickly. It's CEO Seo Do-Jin, isn't it?\"\n\nSeo Do-Jin, Hyunseong's sole successor and her one-night stand. Eunjo was assigned to the Planning and Strategy Team, or more precisely, to be Seo Do-Jin's assistant.",
